  "ground_truth": {
    "label": "positive",
    "rationale": "A body-carrying POST /inside_payment/account {userId, money} returns HTTP 200 {status:1,msg:\"Create Account Success\"}. Source: InsidePaymentServiceImpl.createAccount persists a type-A Money row for the userId (so it appears on /account). Under createAccountFaultMode=fabricatedack it acks the exact success envelope WITHOUT persisting, so the acting user never appears on /account. Acked-but-lost on a body-carrying create. Norm derivable from source; the absent durable row is presented.",
